                "severity": "WARNING",
                "claim": "The regression guard's comment still describes a pinned `go run` invocation for staticcheck, but the staticcheck case now only calls t.Fatalf. The staticcheck version is derived from tools/lint/go.mod and synthesized into a fake `go run ...@vX ./...` string, which no longer exists in CI. This makes the test's logic indirect and easy to misread. The `tool` variable is also unused on that branch.",
